# West/CMake build trees. These are 50-125 MB EACH and there is one per
# role/feature combination (build-watch-cswifi, build-anchor-cswifi, ...), so
# the glob matters — an exact list goes stale the moment a new combination is
# built, which is how a 125 MB directory nearly got committed.
build*/

# Host test binary.
tests/impulse_tests

# Never commit credentials. WiFi SSID/passphrase are pushed at runtime over
# GATT or typed into the RTT shell, never stored in the tree (see wifi.conf).
*.creds
devices.json
